{"id":"en_love-against-the-darkness","title":"Love Against the Darkness","titleEn":"Love Against the Darkness","description":"When Armaan Malik, a gangster who serves as guardian of an orphanage, crosses paths with Anaya Sharma, an idealistic teacher, the love that grows between them draws him into a conflict between duty and redemption. Enemies, secrets and old wounds come back to the surface, putting their fragile bond to the test. The situation grows more volatile still with the return of Vishal, Anaya’s abusive husband, who reignites the storm around them.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/love-against-the-darkness/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/love-against-the-darkness/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Enemies to Lovers","Sacrificing for Love","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl8uk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_love-against-the-darkness_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl8uk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_love-against-the-darkness_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl8uk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_love-against-the-darkness_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl8uk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_love-against-the-darkness_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl8uk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_love-against-the-darkn